#lem: X; X; Enkik[1]DN; šag[heart]; kušu[tired]; An[1]DN; kug[pure]; ad[voice]; gi[turn]; kur[mountain(s)]; gal[big]; X
#tr.en: Adviser, whose statements cannot be countermanded, whose ways …… fearsomeness. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.7

A.A.8. [sa₂] pad₃-de₃ dug₄-ga-ni nu-kam₃-me a-ra₂-a-ni ni₂ [...]
