#lem: Nudimmud[1]DN; barag[sanctum]; kug[purify]; sipar[an implement]; X; X
#tr.en: @wDN{Nudimmud} …… holy dais ……. Lord imbued with fearsomeness, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.A.10

