#lem: en[lord]; ni[fear]; gur[lift]; An[1]DN; Uraš[1]DN; utud[give birth (to)]; pap[relation]; gal[big]; X
#tr.en: borne by @wDN{An} and @wDN{Uraš}, eldest brother of ……. 
